---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SectionTitle from "../../components/SectionTitle.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy · Maurizio Bertaboni"
  description="Privacy note for Maurizio Bertaboni’s personal site."
  lang="en"
>
  <SectionTitle eyebrow="Privacy" title="A few things, said plainly." />

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      This is a static site. I don’t use profiling cookies, and there’s no cookie
      banner because there’s nothing to accept.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      When enabled, I use <a href="https://www.goatcounter.com/">GoatCounter</a>:
      aggregated visit and page counts (no cookies, no invasive fingerprinting).
      It’s to see whether anyone is reading, not to build a profile of you.
    </p>

    <h2>Content</h2>
    <p>
      Articles are under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>:
      you may reuse them, but please credit the source. They’re provided “as is”,
      with no certification or warranty.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For privacy or reuse questions: use the contacts on About / Projects, or
      open an issue on the site repository.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
